{
  "id": "31475_fukeru",
  "headword": "{更|ふ}ける",
  "reading": "ふける",
  "romaji": "fukeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan, intransitive)",
  "gloss": "to grow late (of the night); to deepen (of a season)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to grow late; to wear on (of the night); to deepen (of a season)",
      "explanation": "For the night, or more literarily a season, to advance toward its deepest point."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31475_fukeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{夜|よ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{更|ふ}ける。",
      "english": "The night grows late.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31475_fukeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{話|はな}している→話す：00467_hanasu⟧うち⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{夜|よ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{更|ふ}けた。",
      "english": "While we talked, the night wore on.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31475_fukeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{秋|あき}→秋：02276_aki⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{更|ふ}けて、⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{木々|きぎ}→木々：04811_kigi⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦すっかり→すっかり：01270_sukkari⟧⟦{赤|あか}く→赤い：00585_akai⟧⟦{色|いろ}づいた→色づく：10074_irozuku⟧。",
      "english": "Autumn deepened, and the trees on the mountain turned completely red.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Mostly in the past or the て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ form: {夜|よ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{更|ふ}けてきた (it is getting late).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {夜|よ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{更|ふ}ける: the night grows late\n- {夜|よ}⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{更|ふ}けて: late into the night\n- ⟦{夜更|よふ}け→夜更け：12167_yofuke⟧: late at night\n- ⟦{秋|あき}→秋：02276_aki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{更|ふ}ける: autumn deepens\n\nWATCH OUT:\nThree verbs share the reading ⟦ふける→ふける：09960_fukeru⟧: {更|ふ}ける (of time, to grow late), ⟦{老|ふ}ける→老ける：16742_fukeru⟧ (to age, to look old), and {耽|ふけ}る (to be absorbed in). The first two are ichidan; {耽|ふけ}る is godan.",
